From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert Sturla <rsturla@redhat.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Modify environment variables defaults

- Set GOTOOLCHAIN to local
- Set GOPPC64 to power9
---
 go.env | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/go.env b/go.env
index 6ff2b921d4..0bff84446c 100644
--- a/go.env
+++ b/go.env
@@ -9,4 +9,8 @@ GOSUMDB=sum.golang.org
 
 # Automatically download newer toolchains as directed by go.mod files.
 # See https://go.dev/doc/toolchain for details.
-GOTOOLCHAIN=auto
+GOTOOLCHAIN=local
+
+# The PPC64LE baseline for RHEL10 is power9
+GOPPC64=power9
+
-- 
2.45.1
